{
  "action": "go_home",
  "words": "",
  "intention": "Protect the integrity of Alma's private recording by keeping the physical reel in my possession and refusing to transfer it to the public patch, then end the shift.","detail": "I watch the ballroom lights flare, then I cap the lens, place the camera in its case, and walk out the side door toward the parking lot. I do not stop at the station line. The reel stays in my bag. I leave the festival grounds without speaking to anyone else."
}
